<title>USA: FGIC qualifies six municipal bond issues.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies six municipal bond issues.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. on Thursday said it qualified the following six municipal bond issues scheduled for competitive sale:</p>
<p>--Albany, N.Y., Central School District, General Obligations (GOs), $5 million.</p>
<p>--Peralta Community College District, Calif., $8 miilion GOs.</p>
<p>--Berlin, Conn., GOs, $5.5 million.</p>
<p>--Mendon Upton Reg, Mass., School District, GOs, $24.996 million.</p>
<p>--Cohoes City, N.Y., School District, $5 million.</p>
<p>--Smithfield, Rhode Island, GOs, $9.16 million.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
